-- title:
--   Split of `N` (truncation, report L8) (round six, `nsplit`)
-- statement:
--   **Split of `N` (truncation, report L8):** `N x = M x + Δ x + drop`,
--   `|drop| ≤ 4 e^{-πα² w(w+1)} ‖x‖`.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegGlob`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.nsplit (hB : BlocksOK s t B) (hs : 0 < s) (hst : s ≤ t) (hα : 2 ≤ α)
--       (hx1 : 1 ≤ xθ s t α) (x : ℕ → ℝ) (X : ℝ) (hX : ∀ k < s, |x k| ≤ X) {i : ℕ} (hi : i < s) :
--       |NxR s t α x i - (Mv (blS B) (MxG s t α) x i + Dv (Hset B) (col B.s) (cfG s t α) x i)| ≤
--         4 * exp (-(π * (α : ℝ) ^ 2 * (B.w * (B.w + 1)))) * X
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Segmented inverse (S2): the resampling system split into blocks, coupling and tail
--
--   For a valid block structure (`BlocksOK`: blocks are wrap-free runs `[st i, st i + len i)` that
--   partition `[0, s)`, coupling width `w ≤ s`):
--   * `MxG` (the block part of `N`, entries `δ_{ik} + e_{i,k-i}`) and `MiG` (its exact block inverse
--     `D T⁻¹ D⁻¹` from the q-LU) satisfy `M M⁻¹ = I` (`hinvG`, via `eEx_recentre`, `MF_mul_MinvF`);
--   * row sums: `‖M - I‖, ‖Δ‖ ≤ 2^{-α²θ}` (`rowM`, `rowD`), hence `‖M⁻¹‖ ≤ 8/7` when `α²θ ≥ 3`;
--   * every coupling column lies in the capacitance set `Jlist` (`col_mem`);
--   * `nsplit`: `(N x)_i = (M x)_i + (Δ x)_i + drop`, `|drop| ≤ 4 e^{-πα² w(w+1)} ‖x‖`;
--   * `nearN`: `‖N d‖ ≤ ρ ⇒ ‖d‖ ≤ 8ρ/7` (`‖N - I‖ ≤ 1/8`).
